{"synopsis":"Dari studio yang mengerjakan \\[Chronicles Of The Reincarnated Demon God]\nBlacksmith terakhir sekaligus pengrajin ulung yang tersisa di dunia.\n\nTangannya hancur karena kebakaran di bengkel, membuatnya tak bisa lagi menempa.\nNamun, sebuah game realitas virtual bernama Ares pun datang mengetuk pintu Hyun-soo.\n\n\\[Artefak Tak Dapat Diperbaiki.]\n\\[Tidak dapat ditempa karena batasan level.]\n\n“Eh? Tapi aku ini Blacksmith manual, loh.”\nBagi dirinya, batasan sistem sama sekali tak berlaku.\n\nBegitulah dimulainya permainan penuh gejolak sang Blacksmith jenius.","alternative_title":"천재 대장장이의 게임","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"fa5b6062-3cd9-4c40-97c8-dad2d2a4cb69","number":"65","chapter":"65","title":"","date":"2026-08-01","released":"2026-08-01","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3bcb1d69-5d2c-458c-96bb-d208323afd91/chapter_ch_65/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3bcb1d69-5d2c-458c-96bb-d208323afd91/chapter_ch_65/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3bcb1d69-5d2c-458c-96bb-d208323afd91/chapter_ch_65/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3bcb1d69-5d2c-458c-96bb-d208323afd91/chapter_ch_65/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3bcb1d69-5d2c-458c-96bb-d208323afd91/chapter_ch_65/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3bcb1d69-5d2c-458c-96bb-d208323afd91/chapter_ch_65/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3bcb1d69-5d2c-458c-96bb-d208323afd91/chapter_ch_65/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3bcb1d69-5d2c-458c-96bb-d208323afd91/chapter_ch_65/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3bcb1d69-5d2c-458c-96bb-d208323afd91/chapter_ch_65/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3bcb1d69-5d2c-458c-96bb-d208323afd91/chapter_ch_65/10.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3bcb1d69-5d2c-458c-96bb-d208323afd91/chapter_ch_65/11.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3bcb1d69-5d2c-458c-96bb-d208323afd91/chapter_ch_65/12.webp"]},{"